OL,3,GNEWSADoctor in court to face Rwanda
OL,4,Agenocide charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was told he faced a charge of
OL,7,Fconduct ancillary to genocide and six
OL,8,Foffences of conduct ancillary to
OL,9,Fmurder, as a crime against humanity.
